# Trivy ignore list for qBittorrent-Fixed.
# Format: one CVE/ID per line, optional `# reason` comment, optional
# expiry `# expires: YYYY-MM-DD`.
#
# The actual, enforced ignore list Trivy + the scanner-config test suite
# read is `.trivyignore.yaml` (structured YAML) at the repo root — this
# plain-text file is kept only as the legacy documented format pointer.
# `tests/unit/test_scan_config.py` enforces the expiry policy against
# `.trivyignore.yaml`: every entry needs a real CVE id, a reason, and an
# `expires` date that is not in the past — do not forget to renew.
